  "title": "Liquor Control director retirement and replacement search",
  "summary": "The Liquor Control Commission voted unanimously on September 21 to use an open application process and to create a temporary investigative group to find a new director. That group will hire a search firm to gather, screen and rank applications, and November 23 is held for a possible special meeting to prepare for interviews. The director announced his retirement, and the last search took about eight months.",
