      },
      "body": "Liquor Control Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-21",
      "text": "November 23 was held for a possible special meeting to prepare for interviews.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "0NdqPwWtF4o",
        "ts": "1:31:37",
        "endTs": "1:32:07",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:03:50.760Z"
      },
      "body": "Liquor Control Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-21",
      "text": "The group will hire a search firm and work with it to gather, screen and rank applications.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "0NdqPwWtF4o",
        "ts": "1:10:08",
        "endTs": "1:10:49",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:03:50.760Z"
      },
      "body": "Liquor Control Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-21",
      "text": "The commission voted unanimously to create a temporary investigative group, a small team that works outside public meetings.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "0NdqPwWtF4o",
        "ts": "1:10:02",
        "endTs": "1:11:35",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:03:50.760Z"
      },
      "body": "Liquor Control Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-21",
      "text": "The commission voted unanimously for an open application process.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "0NdqPwWtF4o",
        "ts": "0:33:47",
        "endTs": "0:34:22",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:03:50.760Z"
      },
      "body": "Liquor Control Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-21",
      "text": "The director said the last search took about eight months.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "0NdqPwWtF4o",
        "ts": "0:16:19",
        "endTs": "0:16:49",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:03:50.760Z"
      },
      "body": "Liquor Control Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-21",
      "text": "The job requires five years of law enforcement experience, three of them in administrative work.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "0NdqPwWtF4o",
        "ts": "0:11:15",
        "endTs": "0:11:45",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:03:50.760Z"
      },
      "body": "Liquor Control Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-21",
      "text": "The deputy corporation counsel said the county rule calls for a hiring process open to any candidate.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "0NdqPwWtF4o",
        "ts": "0:04:35",
        "endTs": "0:05:09",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:03:50.760Z"
      },
      "body": "Liquor Control Commission"
    },
    {
